{"id":54945,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-natal-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-10-28T17:06:02","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T16:06:02","slug":"grande-premio-natal","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-premio-natal\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Pr\u00e9mio Natal 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio Natal 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Grande Pr\u00e9mio Natal 2026<\/strong> (67\u00ba Continental Grande Pr\u00e9mio de Natal) realiza-se no domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">20 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, atravessando algumas das mais emblem\u00e1ticas avenidas da cidade de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lisboa<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL)<\/strong> e pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Last Lap Eventos Lda.<\/strong>, com o apoio institucional da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Lisboa, esta hist\u00f3rica cl\u00e1ssica natal\u00edcia do calend\u00e1rio nacional junta at\u00e9 8000 participantes num percurso r\u00e1pido e tendencialmente favor\u00e1vel entre Benfica e o cora\u00e7\u00e3o da capital. Planeia os teus parciais na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais provas no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Corridas de 10 km<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Na prova principal de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km<\/strong> (partida em duas vagas \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong> e <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:05<\/strong> na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Avenida Lus\u00edada, em Benfica<\/strong>, junto ao Hospital Lus\u00edadas), os atletas percorrem a Av. Marechal Teixeira Rebelo, o Largo da Luz, a Estrada da Luz, a Rua Francisco Stromp, o Campo Grande, a Avenida da Rep\u00fablica e o Saldanha at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta instalada na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Avenida Fontes Pereira de Melo<\/strong> (junto \u00e0 Pra\u00e7a Marqu\u00eas de Pombal e ao entroncamento com a Av. Ant\u00f3nio Augusto de Aguiar). O evento inclui ainda a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada de 4 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:40<\/strong> no Campo Grande) e quatro <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Provas Jovens<\/strong>: Benjamins 500 m (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:40<\/strong>), Infantis 1 km (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:45<\/strong>), Iniciados 1,8 km (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:50<\/strong>) e Juvenis 4 km (<strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Todos os atletas inscritos t\u00eam direito a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial de manga comprida<\/strong> (modelos masculino e feminino), dorsal personalizado com indica\u00e7\u00e3o da caixa de partida (Elite, Sub-40 a +60m), abastecimentos aos 5 km e na meta, brinde finisher e diploma digital com tempos aos 5 km e 10 km. O levantamento do kit decorre nos dias 17, 18 e 19 de dezembro na Decathlon Amadora (das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00).<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">20 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" st